The tester's chat #9 (conv 44420, 1 of 3): „რისი ცოდნა გინდა ჩემზე?" put
the profile question only in a live step bubble, and the kept message was
„ვუცდი შენს პასუხს." under five answer buttons. Once the bubble was gone,
the owner saw buttons with no question.

The run now keeps every step bubble it showed. When the model's final
message carries buttons and asks nothing, the newest question from those
steps is put in front of it, word for word. It applies only to the model's
own buttons, before the server's correction lines (3302, 3796, 2608) set
theirs. No new words.

